  "sensitivity_selection": "One request per patient, seeded, before all per-variable exclusions; no replacement for missing vitals",
  "multiplicity": "Holm across all primary+secondary omnibus tests within each cohort; posthoc gated by adjusted omnibus significance and Holm within each parent/cohort across all its contrasts",
  "tukey_note": "Tukey p-values already control FWER; additional requested Holm is conservative",
  "numeric_assumptions": "Group Shapiro (seeded maximum 5000) and median-centred Levene at alpha; non-rejection does not establish assumptions; KW for failures, no median-only claim without common shapes",
